{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651400/extras/title_logo_-_\u526f\u672c.png?t=1740671980\" /><strong>Exquisite Touhou Danmaku, Seven Years in the Making</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cThe Unreachable Oneiroborder\u201d is a Touhou Project danmaku shoot-em-up fangame. The game is easy to learn, regardless of your prior experience with bullet hells. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651400/extras/en_bs.png?t=1740671980\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perhaps you\u2019ve imagined your dreams coming true? One day, humans' dreams materialized into reality, satisfying their cravings and fulfilling their desires\u2026 a fantastic development, certainly. Yet, after the first nightmare materialized itself, sleep became an unspeakably horrific taboo in Gensokyo. The Dream Manifestation Incident has begun\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of Reimu Hakurei, Marisa Kirisame, Sanae Kochiya and Sumireko Usami; uncover the truth behind the suspicious phenomenon, and solve the incident that has shaken Gensokyo's very foundations. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651400/extras/try.png?t=1740671980\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Dazzling Showcase of Danmaku</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651400/extras/\u52a8\u753b13.gif?t=1740671980\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651400/extras/\u52a8\u753b11.gif?t=1740671980\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unleash Stylish Counterattacks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651400/extras/\u52a8\u753b15.gif?t=1740671980\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651400/extras/\u52a8\u753b16.gif?t=1740671980\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651400/extras/en_f.png?t=1740671980\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic vertical shmup with modern features </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Witness beautiful danmaku performances, and break through the enemies\u2019 prized spell card attacks! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the thrill of bullet grazing by, as you improve your skills in intense battles </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Difficulty levels to accommodate all skill levels, from complete beginners to seasoned experts </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple modes with different gameplay styles </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 shottype configurations with 6 different spell cards each, tailored to resolving the incident </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersive music and visuals to bring you a Touhou-filled experience </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather \u201cDreamscape Fragments\u201d in the game to peruse the sights and sounds of Gensokyo in the Gallery </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Modernized Player Data menus with extensive options and details to reminisce upon your past records</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1651400?t=1740671980","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651400/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740671980","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.